          [
            210.0,
            1372.0
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "block_label": "text",
        "block_content": "We performed only a small number of experiments to select the dropout, both attention and residual (section 5.4), learning rates and beam size on the Section 22 development set, all other parameters remained unchanged from the English-to-German base translation model. During inference, we",
